cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Astra, please cite the ContextPipe paper and this software."
title: Astra
type: software
version: 0.2.0
authors:
  - name: MatrixOrigin
repository-code: "https://github.com/matrixorigin/Astra"
url: "https://github.com/matrixorigin/Astra"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Astra is an enterprise agent runtime that unifies CLI, Server, and Edge
  execution with durable runs, governed User Runners, traceability, policy,
  and a database-inspired Context Pipeline.
keywords:
  - enterprise agents
  - agent runtime
  - context engineering
  - context pipeline
  - user runner
  - observability

